    "title": "Is H-E-B open on Easter?",
    "text": "clickMySA LogoHearst Newspapers LogoSkip to main contentclose dialogAdvertisementclose dialogBusinessIs H-E-B open on Easter? Here are the store hours.Here's what you need to know before heading out to the store.By Priscilla Aguirre, Weekend EditorApril 5, 2026Sign at the entrance of an H-E-B Plus grocery store. H-E-B will be closed for Easter Sunday.TrongNguyen/Getty ImagesWith Easter here, people are rushing to grocery stores to buy much-needed items like potato salad, chicken, brisket, basket fillers and chocolate bunnies. But you have to go before Easter Sunday, because some beloved grocers are closed.0:36/1:00Skip AdKeep WatchingSan Antonio-based H-E-B is closed on Easter on Sunday, April 5, according to its website. Central Market will also be closed on Easter Sunday. No Curbside or home delivery order services will be available that day.AdvertisementArticle continues below this adDon't worry, H-E-B won't be closed for long. It will open on Monday, April 6, with regular hours, and curbside and home delivery will begin at 9 a.m., according to its website.Easter isn't recognized as a federal holiday in the United States, partly because it always falls on a Sunday, when federal offices are already closed. While not a federal holiday, it is a significant religious holiday and some private businesses may choose to close.More For YouPopular Texas winery just opened something big in Hill CountryWine, wood-fired pizza and live music are now part of the experience at a new Hill Country destination.Are you a Dollar General customer eligible for the $8.5M settlement?Shop at Dollar General? You could get some cash back. Buc-ee’s rival revs up $1.7M Texas expansion with more new storesLet the battle with the beavs begin.South Texas cities among worst to try to start a businessLimited resources and smaller markets hold back local startups in these Texas cities.Purr-fect spot: New San Antonio cat café reveals locationCat lovers rejoice!What supermarkets are closed for EasterH-E-B and Central Market aren't the only stores closed for Easter. The following supermarkets are closed for Easter:AdvertisementArticle continues below this adMySA LogoWant more MySA?Make us a Preferred Source on Google to see more of us when you search.Add Preferred Source Costco Target Sam's H-E-B and Central Market What stores are open for Easter?If you need last-minute holiday shopping on Easter Sunday, there will be stores available for you procrastinators. The following stores are open for Easter:AdvertisementArticle continues below this ad Walmart Trader Joe's Whole Foods April 5, 2026Priscilla AguirreWeekend EditorBorn and raised in San Antonio, Priscilla knows her city well. She has a B.A. in Communications from UIW and has been with the Express-News and MySA since 2019. Priscilla loves writing about hikes, parks and weird sea (and land) creatures in San Antonio and Texas.Most Popular1.What to know before you take a nap in your car in Texas2.Texas is losing one of its smallest Buc-ee's stores after 26 years3.H-E-B leads retail boom in bustling TX Hill Country town4.New details in school shooting that injured S.A.-area teacher5.Free coffee offer for Spurs playoff wins? S.A. coffee shop steps inBest OfReaders' ChoiceYourSA 2026 winners are here! Did your faves win?Explore the best in San Antonio for dining, beauty, entertainment and more.Readers' ChoiceThe best tax services in San AntonioFile smarter, not harder, with help from the people who actually read the fine print.Readers' ChoiceThese private schools in San Antonio are kid-tested, parent-approvedAccording to locals, these are the schools worth touring.Readers' ChoiceThe best foundation repair companies in San AntonioYour dream home deserves a solid foundation.Readers' ChoiceThe best med spas in San AntonioTo look your best, you’ve got to work with the best.Around The WebMissouri Locals Are Obsessed With This 250th Patriotic WreathPeoasisNeuropathy is Not From Low Vitamin B. Meet The Real 